DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261008
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261009
SUMMARY:🔄 ARC Raiders · Frozen Trail
DESCRIPTION:Game: ARC Raiders\nType: Major Update\nStatus: Confirmed\n\nMaj
 or content update adding Pendola Pass\, the Frigate challenge\, new ARC en
 emies\, Outposts\, weapon upgrades\, gadgets\, and Reward Passes. The offi
 cial content preview confirms October 8 but provides no exact launch hour.
  The separately announced free-play start time is not used as the update's
  launch time\; cosmetic DLC and free-play promotions are not separate cale
 ndar events.\n\nLatest news:\nFrozen Trail arrives October 8\, 2026\, addi
 ng Pendola Pass\, the Frigate challenge\, new ARC enemies\, customizable O
 utposts\, and deeper weapon progression. Embark also introduces Reward Pas
 ses with this major update.\n\nNews source:\nhttps://arcraiders.com/news/f
 rozen-trail-content-preview\n\nEvent source:\nhttps://arcraiders.com/news/
 frozen-trail-content-preview
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
