SUMMARY:🧩 Crimson Desert · Charting the Unknown
DESCRIPTION:Game: Crimson Desert\nType: Dlc\nStatus: Confirmed\n\nRevised r
 elease date replaces the original October 15 announcement after a two-week
  delay. Official release time: October 29\, 2026 at 22:00 UTC\, or 23:00 E
 urope/Prague (CET). The publisher notice incorrectly labels the European t
 imezone CEST for this date.\n\nLatest news:\nPearl Abyss delayed the Chart
 ing the Unknown DLC by two weeks to October 29\, 2026\, to improve polish 
 and stability. The revised release time is 22:00 UTC\, which is 23:00 in P
 rague.\n\nNews source:\nhttps://crimsondesert.pearlabyss.com/en-US/News/No
 tice/Detail?_boardNo=134\n\nEvent source:\nhttps://crimsondesert.pearlabys
 s.com/en-US/News/Notice/Detail?_boardNo=134\n\nSource start: 2026-10-29T22
 :00:00Z\nSource timezone: UTC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:gray-zone-warfare-rogue-ops@gaming-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261005T183849Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261005T183849Z
X-GAMING-CALENDAR-MANAGED:TRUE
X-GAMING-CALENDAR-GAME-ID:gray-zone-warfare
X-GAMING-CALENDAR-EVENT-ID:gray-zone-warfare-rogue-ops
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261022
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261023
SUMMARY:🔄 Gray Zone Warfare · Rogue Ops 0.5
DESCRIPTION:Game: Gray Zone Warfare\nType: Major Update\nStatus: Confirmed\
 n\nMajor content update and transition from pre-alpha to alpha\, with Hide
 out building\, crafting\, smuggling activities\, new locations and weapons
 . A soft wipe retains rank\, apparel\, vendor levels and completed tasks\,
  but resets lockers and money. Launch time has not been announced in this 
 source.\n\nLatest news:\nRogue Ops brings Hideout and crafting systems\, m
 ultiple playable characters\, and major gameplay improvements as the game 
 enters alpha. The update uses a soft wipe that retains progression but res
 ets lockers and money. Supporter Preview begins October 19\, followed by t
 he public update on October 22\, 2026.\n\nNews source:\nhttps://www.grayzo
 newarfare.com/news/player-driven-improvements-rogue-ops\n\nEvent source:\n
 https://www.grayzonewarfare.com/news/update-05-teaser
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
