DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261019
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261020
SUMMARY:🚀 Gray Zone Warfare · Rogue Ops 0.5 Supporter Preview
DESCRIPTION:Game: Gray Zone Warfare\nType: Early Access\nStatus: Confirmed\
 n\nEarly preview of the major Rogue Ops update\, available to Supporter Ed
 ition owners only. This is a preview milestone\, not the public update rel
 ease or a new base-game launch. Launch time has not been announced in this
  source.\n\nLatest news:\nRogue Ops brings Hideout and crafting systems\, 
 multiple playable characters\, and major gameplay improvements as the game
  enters alpha. The update uses a soft wipe that retains progression but re
 sets lockers and money. Supporter Preview begins October 19\, followed by 
 the public update on October 22\, 2026.\n\nNews source:\nhttps://www.grayz
 onewarfare.com/news/player-driven-improvements-rogue-ops\n\nEvent source:\
 nhttps://www.grayzonewarfare.com/news/update-05-teaser
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:marathon-nightfall-refresh@gaming-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261006T140631Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T140631Z
X-GAMING-CALENDAR-MANAGED:TRUE
X-GAMING-CALENDAR-GAME-ID:marathon
X-GAMING-CALENDAR-EVENT-ID:marathon-nightfall-refresh
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261006
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261007
SUMMARY:🔄 Marathon · Nightfall Refresh
DESCRIPTION:Game: Marathon\nType: Major Update\nStatus: Confirmed\n\nSignif
 icant progression and economy reset with refreshed rewards\, a new Rewards
  Pass\, quality-of-life improvements\, and balance changes. This is a refr
 esh within Nightfall rather than a new season\; Bungie is moving away from
  a strict seasonal schedule. The dated development announcement does not s
 pecify a launch hour. The live maintenance page labels its October 6 entry
  as Update 1.1.9 and does not identify Nightfall Refresh\, so its download
  and login estimates are not assigned to this event.\n\nLatest news:\nNigh
 tfall Refresh on October 6\, 2026 resets progression and the economy and r
 efreshes rewards. Symbiosis follows December 8 with permanent PvE\, a refr
 eshed Perimeter\, a new Runner shell\, and a social space with a firing ra
 nge. Bungie plans a larger evolution in March 2027\, without an exact day 
 announced.\n\nNews source:\nhttps://www.bungie.net/7/en/News/Article/night
 fallrefreshandsymbiosis\n\nEvent source:\nhttps://www.bungie.net/7/en/News
 /Article/nightfallrefreshandsymbiosis
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:marathon-symbiosis@gaming-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261006T140631Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T140631Z
X-GAMING-CALENDAR-MANAGED:TRUE
X-GAMING-CALENDAR-GAME-ID:marathon
X-GAMING-CALENDAR-EVENT-ID:marathon-symbiosis
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261208
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261209
SUMMARY:🔄 Marathon · Symbiosis
DESCRIPTION:Game: Marathon\nType: Major Update\nStatus: Confirmed\n\nMajor 
 update introducing permanent PvE\, a refreshed Perimeter\, a new Runner sh
 ell\, a social space with a firing range\, experimental Team Deathmatch\, 
 and improved onboarding. This replaces content previously planned for Sept
 ember 22. Bungie confirms December 8 without an exact launch hour\; the br
 oader March 2027 evolution is not exported until a specific date is announ
 ced.\n\nLatest news:\nNightfall Refresh on October 6\, 2026 resets progres
 sion and the economy and refreshes rewards. Symbiosis follows December 8 w
 ith permanent PvE\, a refreshed Perimeter\, a new Runner shell\, and a soc
 ial space with a firing range. Bungie plans a larger evolution in March 20
 27\, without an exact day announced.\n\nNews source:\nhttps://www.bungie.n
 et/7/en/News/Article/nightfallrefreshandsymbiosis\n\nEvent source:\nhttps:
 //www.bungie.net/7/en/News/Article/nightfallrefreshandsymbiosis
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
